<title>FINLAND: OPSTOCK NAMES JAAKKO NIEMELA HEAD OF BROKERAGE.</title>
<headline>OPSTOCK NAMES JAAKKO NIEMELA HEAD OF BROKERAGE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opstock group, part of banking group OKOBANK, said in a statement received on Wednesday it had appointed Jaakko Niemela director in charge of operations of its Opstock Securities brokerage arm.</p>
<p>The appointment was effective as of January 1, 1997, Opstock said.</p>
<p>Harri Mokkala was appointed director in charge of the group's Opstock Asset Management unit.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
